{"text":"democratically elected. This has allowed me to lead the protracted processes of national transformation. Change needed to address a longstanding environment characterized by such awesome challenges as a collapsed economy, huge domestic and external debt arrears, dysfunctional institutions, ruined infrastructure and social capital, poor regional and international relationships, all completely degraded by the scourge of civil war. After election, I moved quickly in mobilizing our governance team, sought support from partners, and tackled the challenges. For more information, visit www.fema.gov","words":[{"text":"democratically","start":0.0,"end":1.06},{"text":"elected","start":1.06,"end":2.08,"punct":"."},{"text":"This","start":12.24,"end":12.44},{"text":"has","start":12.44,"end":12.7},{"text":"allowed","start":12.7,"end":13.1},{"text":"me","start":13.1,"end":13.44},{"text":"to","start":13.44,"end":13.66},{"text":"lead","start":13.66,"end":13.94},{"text":"the","start":13.94,"end":14.14},{"text":"protracted","start":14.14,"end":14.66},{"text":"processes","start":14.66,"end":15.34},{"text":"of","start":15.34,"end":15.6},{"text":"national","start":15.6,"end":16.04},{"text":"transformation","start":16.04,"end":16.94,"punct":"."},{"text":"Change","start":18.22,"end":18.4},{"text":"needed","start":18.4,"end":18.82},{"text":"to","start":18.82,"end":19.04},{"text":"address","start":19.04,"end":19.44},{"text":"a","start":19.44,"end":19.72},{"text":"longstanding","start":19.72,"end":20.2},{"text":"environment","start":20.2,"end":21.1},{"text":"characterized","start":22.0,"end":22.48},{"text":"by","start":22.48,"end":23.2},{"text":"such","start":23.2,"end":23.42},{"text":"awesome","start":23.42,"end":24.08},{"text":"challenges","start":24.08,"end":24.74},{"text":"as","start":24.74,"end":25.86},{"text":"a","start":25.86,"end":26.02},{"text":"collapsed","start":26.02,"end":26.32},{"text":"economy","start":26.32,"end":26.98,"punct":","},{"text":"huge","start":26.98,"end":2